  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:024886d5cac22a388d11e911",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实我在途中把护身符弄掉了……\\n没弄掉的话就是满分了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bd061d6dc8b329c009dfa7023a8802b839fad95ae1c366e30d59831f54346a1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b51e95a35b0707a61774ef08",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "完美之类的赞誉还是先保留起来吧。\\n因为我下次会让你们更加兴奋……明白了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecc796fcea3fc774be9a80a358533e2bcbf882c1d59397dba651ea446db45c8b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd07fa591e542e16060e9e65",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会赢。我要用会让全场观众都\\n大吃一惊且难以忘怀的表现获胜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8e71266d4daaeaff8d6d7638b5aab2a9348cb7e21f969b3c50030635cbcf84f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1d7b443d3623150cb54e311",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "称不上是──Easy travel。\\n但果然是场强敌环伺的──好比赛──",
      "source_fingerprint": "1500019bf73878a8094aa8ce9bef6ad513034bbc7c41bff6b52d5e7003f6b0a0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e95924bd6c5cac05917db94a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "师父、象征家，还有──训练员。\\n我要向所有指引我的人们──献上谢谢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "049b6a8d7e156d991fb2ca599870c3ec8fc573b047ff9937aafa4af14bbed4d6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8555329797f2ced3a98df83",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一根「完整的」Musa spp\\n──但不包含外皮哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e101469aa43d158c99fa5866da9cb9d374a2ac8d77c747a3adb3bc22a4e2668",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37e3865e684fe9b5edc3c5a5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大家「提出」自己「喜欢」的歌曲──\\n一起透过「太空会合」「品味」哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f479f67ca4489ffa7593cdf3c93f8d264f2b17a93538a1e5ba0c03c5e59cd537",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd64dd80a9df58c97f7e5cb3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "「FINAO」。不过，新宇宙顺利在\\n「月球表面」着陆──抵达「胜利」了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4503cb03b327c5756e8b8a39e1ab29b4d9023a20f932790ec446052cffc6aad5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e521beefa12d6236949aaa4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "希望能到达──「FTL」的境界。\\n因为我「想探索」138亿光年的彼端。",
      "source_fingerprint": "434621ae10bea525e16162eefd649a22ea678aa5a45b6dc84fccd1ecfb8a4d1e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbfa5faebb9a1d56e309dd7d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "肯定，众人皆是「一等星」。换句话说就是\\n「星间飞行」──让我「热血沸腾」呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "112cb2844c60cea3e5b1b4a64b30d8c078e215e14605044fde684cca42b27df1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab9924c8991e6433511f263d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "「FINAO」。不过，新宇宙顺利在\\n「月面」着陆──抵达「胜利」了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "693a03a81750768ab66c07f2c0db503b93767d47caa738a1c9d61eef862899bf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf895c9c3ef1fee2758c4fc6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "希望能到达──「FTL」的境界。\\n因为我「想探索」138亿光年的彼端。",
      "source_fingerprint": "434621ae10bea525e16162eefd649a22ea678aa5a45b6dc84fccd1ecfb8a4d1e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f1b6fc9624dffd8d07d624c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "肯定，众人皆是「一等星」。换句话说就是\\n「星间飞行」──让我「热血沸腾」呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "112cb2844c60cea3e5b1b4a64b30d8c078e215e14605044fde684cca42b27df1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:919989a6590712120e340350",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我虽然还不成熟，但竞赛应该\\n与年龄无关，我会加油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4a7966c95f119540f934355088ad2bf25755a6a3d93ae3778a2cd39561aafd6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d28bfaead6bec2530c7fbb5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "「类星体」──欢喜、侥幸、耀眼，\\n也就是说──「非常高兴」……哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddb4a138259114f173e5f7d1da66401ffc585d05e6a879630cbabc6898b61ec8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da2806d5e185cfe45d2fc283",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我想对给我最棒的sphilar的训练员说\\n──「谢谢你」喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ef9fa69312542721658efa9fc63fa751f255fc7b46e8d3fe17316229be900e5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf6045fd9223bc1122a0c533",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "「类星体」──欢喜、侥幸、耀眼，\\n也就是说──「非常高兴」……哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddb4a138259114f173e5f7d1da66401ffc585d05e6a879630cbabc6898b61ec8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:477d556ca2327d011ee3c4ad",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我想对给我最棒的sphilar的训练员说\\n──「谢谢你」喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ef9fa69312542721658efa9fc63fa751f255fc7b46e8d3fe17316229be900e5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cec5c7a494599be1b4740452",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当、当然是很紧张啊～！\\n深呼吸，深呼吸……吸～吐～",
      "source_fingerprint": "383d7b660d9b5ad996ba484f126e528a3e398fad22658bea46fe72a4c4fe8d34",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f98322fd3d0faf6076998033",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "决、决赛！？我还没有想过耶～\\n那个，反过来说，你觉得我有机会吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb84096d8ae816eb9f0bbcda6980311df68a596aaa6f4fec58020105a83da2ba",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc347c57a1ba4d5ff21f0493",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "说句话！？说句话……说、说句话……\\n像是下次我也会赢喔……之类的吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "40a90bb0256a62bd52a6f365601726e62f9d55911333d25dbd321e9a9ab4eb7e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c57a631d2327f6d9d1837cfe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真是的～每次获胜大家就会开我名字的玩笑。\\n但我并不讨厌就是了……耶嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9149e8a97b044bcc5b7d1c17d61c47d2bbfb7527d860c90671218d215c0838f4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e7aab2650aae21527cc02ea",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然中上程度的支持度让我比较静得下心，\\n不过……老实说我很开心～耶嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "74bb3fdb46d8e5186349ddced459765ffe20480f293275b81cb7af3c92378067",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb791240403d18c76dc89ba0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "说句话！？说句话……说、说句话……\\n像是下次我也会赢喔……之类的吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "40a90bb0256a62bd52a6f365601726e62f9d55911333d25dbd321e9a9ab4eb7e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc422370e3e71c71ef242441",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是因为我妈妈传了非洲菊的照片给我的关系。\\n它的花语是「希望」和「不断前进」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "071c12e4e30d5aa0a58b117e6f5994db988dc3714eb89a8c9df253daf7189cc0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e956774bce3cb1a1bb4fe440",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真是的～每次获胜大家就会开我名字的玩笑。\\n但我并不讨厌就是了……耶嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9149e8a97b044bcc5b7d1c17d61c47d2bbfb7527d860c90671218d215c0838f4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18cf4425b156ab23cbe5c2f1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然中上程度的支持度让我比较静得下心，\\n不过……老实说我很开心～耶嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "74bb3fdb46d8e5186349ddced459765ffe20480f293275b81cb7af3c92378067",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42a675e929774eaa9546a3ad",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "耶嘿嘿，要来个粉丝服务之类的吗？\\n谢谢大家的支持喔～！开玩笑的啦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7024fa7540c1bc12df14d787e859e0cb91f9d60e236dcc388fe13fe2425dd49",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89b92416a30c920f8eda4365",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哎呀～别看我这样，其实我很兴奋。\\n有种「咦？真的是我吗？」的感觉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8afe0a2c7627970909959aa75a090e0cd5ee3f99b370dcde854b8c72ffd753a5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e804cf0c7ef83d43a22906f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "耶嘿嘿，要来个粉丝服务之类的吗？\\n谢谢大家的支持喔～！开玩笑的啦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7024fa7540c1bc12df14d787e859e0cb91f9d60e236dcc388fe13fe2425dd49",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e6445391ac4db11ba733fd8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哎呀～别看我这样，其实我很兴奋。\\n有种「咦？真的是我吗？」的感觉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8afe0a2c7627970909959aa75a090e0cd5ee3f99b370dcde854b8c72ffd753a5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38cf35b90c0c6cf7fc691399",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我已告诉过他不需举杯庆祝──别搞错了。\\n我就是庆祝胜利的酒杯！众人为我心醉便可！",
      "source_fingerprint": "174842ed1878cc96dec8c45c5d848382a640db8e1ad6eed21954af1caf9d073e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60b69b6aa0d5efe311a609fd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "享用晚餐──此刻，我的五脏六腑如同深渊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8784614fa730fb0c50d5070dbd7f1f7918b453202d7e36034429759f86383cb3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbca64485f9941d6c0942ff5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "奔跑的新酒（NOUVEAU）是灵感之源。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cecbc14db167fc2fd9b1a79faadb6ba125204031b5357ba589ece3b03e8629de",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ac7dfa1b42879845b0cf187",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当然有──那就是胜利的女神（Nike）！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ae4768fafc24f46630198e4b17915f9471ef1f08309e3d3fdf3aebd836786ce",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d82fb1ad48f11300c4c3291",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我最喜欢跟大家一起跑步了♪\\n获胜的话就又可以跟大家一起跑啰！太好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22f3293495dc6772b1ad2edc12c634e49a68c6b03a0094cb1a5ce4d0eab52b55",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93d7ccb4e41a957a4a50e10d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比起永恒闪耀的星光，\\n不如化为贯穿黑夜的雷电。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff4fb0632b0cc771a4e94ad50cf6c7532144cfe21287b72680d4c69a4a28dc4a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2785023c324fe4caa5223ee3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "奔跑的新酒（NOUVEAU）是灵感之源。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cecbc14db167fc2fd9b1a79faadb6ba125204031b5357ba589ece3b03e8629de",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0324fce5a64661572a4691ef",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当然有──那就是胜利的女神（Nike）！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ae4768fafc24f46630198e4b17915f9471ef1f08309e3d3fdf3aebd836786ce",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
