    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12b428c29cbf1764e8be54ed",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的足迹是胜利的符文。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d09efc9e6d32847779ca3d47f6031cd84674ccbaef539467f93b2f5a45a40ef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:970a2b408a9cbb5ec79e340b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那么，报导里就这么写吧。\\n──「美酒的速度太快了」！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1245265bedb48391099f5a7ddbbb0e79646207e57f504762ff0ebee40d2d68b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb44a666aa4d2b477253662d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的足迹是胜利的符文。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d09efc9e6d32847779ca3d47f6031cd84674ccbaef539467f93b2f5a45a40ef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4ee856c863516f713467f0d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那么，报导里就这么写吧。\\n──「美酒的速度太快了」！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1245265bedb48391099f5a7ddbbb0e79646207e57f504762ff0ebee40d2d68b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a439f476fd20623d96bfbbec",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我和老家的狗经常一起追逐！\\n嘿嘿，最初的竞争对手或许是它吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ac4c0277e6e7594025f44d095698e94217617b5f821e7c4256a0b8283bc2660",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bea7e400ffd0139399d681c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "竟然有这么多强劲的赛马娘……\\n哈哈！我兴奋得背脊都在打颤呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d826ba64b52e5edb4f1493896372ffd4f5ebe57861822aeb6af5d080d57e1850",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2935ded5779a7b2c831c63d6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "「乌拉拉漫游」！是去寻找暖～呼呼场所的\\n探险活动！既开心又好玩喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4b375dbd211652679bf7f7508657304d8e12a3685b0d126f86fed3d77274a5e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c9cab2d873f6617803cfe6e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "找到「想赢过她」的强敌！\\n就像对我而言如天衣无缝般的那个赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5cfc47f5c784a21f0edf3530f968c1efe8aa1068d1c42abbaa915a7f36c97b6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4524b4c5c1c32f0fb84784f5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯～我想是和训练员一起吃的饭吧！\\n和那个人在一起会让我的心情很放松。",
      "source_fingerprint": "84cecebb59af7d728f7604e66364531c86e4117ec03123972e61bb29cdda0819",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ff5853ab3be791318e75655",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "气氛非常热烈啊！这么多的人潮，\\n在故乡的烟火大会也很难看到！",
      "source_fingerprint": "00545a00029e93f24fbceef105ce26df3acd42a4a543f9fb67e7406bb7065c75",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:beea20ddab086ad4a7b154e4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "找到「想赢过她」的强敌！\\n就像对我而言如天衣无缝般的那个赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5cfc47f5c784a21f0edf3530f968c1efe8aa1068d1c42abbaa915a7f36c97b6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63a4763f1da3fe1ff337e030",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯～我想是和训练员一起吃的饭吧！\\n和那个人在一起会让我的心情很放松。",
      "source_fingerprint": "84cecebb59af7d728f7604e66364531c86e4117ec03123972e61bb29cdda0819",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
