      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ceebc4b8333402d8f22ebd1f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哈哈，可以说「我做到啦」，对吧！\\n各位都见证了我成为王牌的精彩表现吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e60d2dfe33d38bf698bd1e221adcace42ed403c9f0664196adb9b5e7686702fa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2dd4feefc25fe685c270559d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "感觉确实很棒，但可不代表这样就结束了\\n──毕竟我总有一天要成为世界的王牌！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc8e9a3a7dd61cc4ea9a6bf3111abb34e403322f980e5286036685e61c8493c4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:070664cbdba1ff0a77a48353",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哈哈，可以说「我做到啦」，对吧！\\n各位都见证了我成为王牌的精彩表现吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e60d2dfe33d38bf698bd1e221adcace42ed403c9f0664196adb9b5e7686702fa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
