        "1049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19e712f74067b6187e4fac54",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "跑完了一场非常热血的比赛！\\n下一场比赛也会有激烈对决喔──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49a46ffa2a25c2fa9a598bff9586338fc8287147984b65ce49b4926210ecdd6f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93ae58bc794b80e876e5a8ef",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我非常笨拙，所以……只会勇往直前！\\n我与训练员的话语一起奔驰了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "442779df600d89d97ab73d5f2f6ed5b5063d3ae7ff5be54e39f448f801178445",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53ad524f6f3430dbb1ccf887",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "希望在正式上场前不要看到乌鸦。\\n即使看到……我也会闭上眼睛快走！",
      "source_fingerprint": "530158005265d3b84bab691ed78f1202f239be080786e32a0b9aa5c5de44335f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e49997df89ea7b894f2c5c48",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真的很高兴！不管怎么样，亲手做的东西\\n总是会让我感动不已！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a33f64d6dbeca3baac4c4c30949ec98edd27acc54509def5b910b428c9e900a7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1052"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6734f8e9059ef08033645422",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会焚香！那是母亲为我调配的花香，\\n闻起来能使我感到安心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fa18e21dabd8a22a6ed423a327dd83faf14a90a349c6964959d897251acc4e5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1053"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a42da0d9192677989a6e3ee",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "胡萝……啊，应该要回答的比较有趣一点。\\n那就……在胡萝卜田！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a68bcdf0ab314d0384c38f042069f72983066b6883c294072e5600861bb3e14b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1054"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd5ea6d0519e3179242b179d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真的很高兴！不管怎么样，亲手做的东西\\n总是会让我感动不已！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a33f64d6dbeca3baac4c4c30949ec98edd27acc54509def5b910b428c9e900a7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1055"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70e3f73e066ed46ea271365a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会焚香！那是母亲为我调配的花香，\\n闻起来能使我感到安心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fa18e21dabd8a22a6ed423a327dd83faf14a90a349c6964959d897251acc4e5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
