        "1057"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf55b5dc68cf283c27abd5ce",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员！因为不管在什么时候，他都是\\n与我最亲近、最给予支持的……重要之人！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6ba012c5e07caaa6086b626aca1967b8c207232c316f9e40436997686674eb1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1058"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:429f7c132a3742443682724c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是的！从今以后也会为了响应\\n众人的期待而持续奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0120f13f24f0a11a6abce8e3db0b1f1d286068e568728492c6df5e0de4b985b8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1059"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b064d94a009db7e39c1edbf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是特大碗精力猪肉盖饭！猪肉的维他命……\\n还是什么有的没的很丰富，非常营养喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a0e2af68364ab9555e962ded674582df2d11fe4cfb850b451a76e4e9d60352e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "106"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:727b8e0cd6c117337c46c5fa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员！因为不管在什么时候，他都是\\n与我最亲近、最给予支持的……重要之人！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6ba012c5e07caaa6086b626aca1967b8c207232c316f9e40436997686674eb1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1060"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3683b911b500fe51078c88a3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是的！从今以后也会为了响应\\n众人的期待而持续奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0120f13f24f0a11a6abce8e3db0b1f1d286068e568728492c6df5e0de4b985b8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1061"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12a98fac8cb4e6434d14752c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谢谢你。对我而言，\n至今为止的一切都是“奇迹”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83569e67734bc4ce5901350e6f436cf9fd32589dd209140c4cc0d5513f4f2510",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1062"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c16071a958430227b3b36816",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "给一直以来为我加油的大家。\n……不知道我的心意，有没有好好传达给你们呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80609f6a703264c15b8b6cd6a38196594579f401a0d0f3fdf650d8f4016c2081",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1063"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34b0e616cfb64bcd82c44cfb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "饮食、身体状况，还有生活的全部……吧。\n为了确保万无一失才走到了这里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f73ae5b9a581b096dd4dffa253b3273504b4526c3bea1706d927ff3c1c1b983b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1064"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54c4b3c941726f4e80dd7477",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "欸……以后的事情，我还真没想过呢。\n让我考虑一下吧。想一些能和大家一起享受的活动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ff8b8599435cf402480e3b4eb4cc9b8a256301007d7d3a7854c6a4e53c23d60",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1065"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6704bdc4269926d15ab28f06",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……，一两句话，大概是说不完的吧。\n因为得到的太多。也太重要了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5265635536b2fccbbcf9c4da2a6b15c08b5dd072a0ca55f8907d74644aa7a08d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
